-05 15:20:00'),(157,'f6cd9b1626f25b6ed58e43a1a6661bbb','TR','Yeni İlanlar','2026-08-05 15:20:00','2026-08-05 15:20:00'),(158,'75a54b31caa91a9c908faa196d4a1b89','TR','Gönderiliyor','2026-08-05 15:20:01','2026-08-05 15:20:01'),(159,'4d3e223e8fdecb815b79b54d9808fde3','ZH','简报','2026-08-05 15:20:45','2026-08-05 15:20:45'),(160,'7742bd10d2057b46c46f4fd77e627387','ZH','第一时间获取每周新闻、优惠和活动信息。只需点击一下，即可随时取消订阅。','2026-08-05 15:20:45','2026-08-05 15:20:45'),(161,'939d5345ad4345dbaabe14798f6ac0f1','ZH','提交','2026-08-05 15:20:45','2026-08-05 15:20:45'),(162,'8050f5763725092fb841edd9b435c879','ZH','您的电子邮件地址','2026-08-05 15:20:46','2026-08-05 15:20:46'),(163,'daa3af6ce23ff059f430c68cb5483286','ZH','版权所有 {copy} {year} 纺织论坛。保留所有权利。','2026-08-05 15:20:46','2026-08-05 15:20:46'),(164,'55837e9c68474874e7a7f64865466a01','ZH','请输入搜索词。','2026-08-05 15:20:46','2026-08-05 15:20:46'),(165,'71e2fe341195b0587911bd8014e7f457','ZH','感谢您的订阅。','2026-08-05 15:20:47','2026-08-05 15:20:47'),(166,'415038821b4525c800280581269c6f0a','ZH','正在提交','2026-08-05 15:20:47','2026-08-05 15:20:47'),(167,'c029d304cd267785a4a807a3073d5e1b','TR','    <section class=\"text-editor-area\" data-padding-top=\"51\" data-padding-bottom=\"61\">\r\n        <div class=\"container-1440\">\r\n            <div class=\"row\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n                     <p>Hakkımızda - Textile Forum</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Tekstil Sektörünün Yenilikçi Gücü</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum, tekstil endüstrisinde köklü bir değişim yaratma amacıyla doğdu. Üreticileri, tedarikçileri, perakendecileri ve alıcıları tek bir çatı altında toplayarak, sektör içi ticaretin hem hızını hem de verimliliğini artırmayı hedefliyoruz. Textileforum.net üzerinden, tekstil sektörünü dijital çağa taşıyor, alım-satım işlemlerini yeniden tasarlıyoruz.</span></p><p><br></p><p>Textile Forum Neden Farklı?</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Kolay ve Hızlı Alım-Satım: Kullanıcılarımız, tekstil ürünleri ve hizmetlerini kolaylıkla ilan edebilecekleri, kullanıcı dostu bir platforma sahip. Gelişmiş arama ve filtreleme seçenekleri sayesinde, tam da aradığınız ürünlere birkaç tıkla ulaşabilirsiniz.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Geniş Ürün ve Kategori Yelpazesi: Kumaştan tekstil makinelerine, moda aksesuarlarından niş ürünlere kadar her türlü tekstil ürünü için özel kategorilerimiz var. Her sektörden işletme ve birey için kapsamlı bir çözüm sunuyoruz.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Güven Odaklı Ticareti: Textile Forum, güvenli ve şeffaf bir ticaret ortamı sağlamak için kullanıcı değerlendirme ve yorum sistemlerini kullanır. Bu sayede, iş partnerlerinizin geçmiş deneyimlerine dair bilgi edinerek daha güvenli iş ilişkileri kurabilirsiniz.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Eğitim ve Bilgi Kaynağı: Sadece bir ticaret platformu değil, tekstil sektörü hakkında en son haberleri, eğitim içeriklerini ve trend analizlerini sunan bir bilgi merkeziyiz. Burada, rekabet avantajı kazanmak için ihtiyaç duyduğunuz tüm bilgilere ulaşabilirsiniz.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Küresel Pazar Erişimi: Uluslararası ticareti kolaylaştırmak için çoklu dil desteği, döviz kuru bilgileri ve lojistik rehberleri sunuyoruz. Textile Forum ile dünyanın her yerine ulaşabilirsiniz.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Reklam ve İşbirliği Fırsatları: Markanızı büyütmek ve geniş kitlelere ulaşmak için çeşitli reklam ve işbirliği seçenekleri sunuyoruz. Stratejik ortaklıklarla, sizi sektörün öncü isimlerinden biri yapmak için çalışıyoruz.</span></p><p><br></p><p>Textile Forum ile Dijital Dönüşüm!</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Misyonumuz, tekstil sektörünü dijitalleştirerek modern ticaretin gereksinimlerine uyum sağlamak. Textile Forum, kullanıcılarına işlerini büyütme, sektördeki etkileşimlerini artırma ve yenilikçi çözümler sunma imkanı sağlıyor.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Gelin, Textile Forum&#x27;un sunduğu bu ayrıcalıkları keşfedin ve tekstil ticaretinizi dijital dünyanın gücüyle bir adım öne taşıyın!</span></p><p><br></p><p>Bize Katılın ve Textile Forum&#x27;un Ayrıcalıklarını Keşfedin!</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>','2026-08-05 15:22:43','2026-08-05 15:22:43'),(168,'2ad05d384961aec0872177b85a2ead61','EN-GB','About Us','2026-08-05 15:24:12','2026-08-05 15:24:12'),(169,'c029d304cd267785a4a807a3073d5e1b','EN-GB','    <section class=\"text-editor-area\" data-padding-top=\"51\" data-padding-bottom=\"61\">\r\n        <div class=\"container-1440\">\r\n            <div class=\"row\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n                     <p>About Us - Textile Forum</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">The Innovative Force of the Textile Sector</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum was founded with the aim of bringing about a fundamental transformation in the textile industry. By bringing together manufacturers, suppliers, retailers and buyers under one roof, we aim to increase both the speed and efficiency of trade within the sector. Through Textileforum.net, we are bringing the textile sector into the digital age and redesigning buying and selling processes.</span></p><p><br></p><p>Why is Textile Forum Different?</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Easy and Fast Buying and Selling: Our users have access to a user-friendly platform where they can easily list textile products and services. Thanks to advanced search and filtering options, you can find exactly the products you’re looking for with just a few clicks.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Wide Range of Products and Categories: We have dedicated categories for every type of textile product, from fabrics to textile machinery, and from fashion accessories to niche products. We offer a comprehensive solution for businesses and individuals across all sectors.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Trust-Focused Trading: Textile Forum utilises user review and rating systems to ensure a secure and transparent trading environment. This enables you to build more secure business relationships by gaining insight into your business partners’ past experiences.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">A Resource for Education and Information: We are not just a trading platform, but a knowledge hub providing the latest news, educational content and trend analyses on the textile sector. Here, you can access all the information you need to gain a competitive edge.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Global Market Access: To facilitate international trade, we offer multilingual support, exchange rate information and logistics guides. With Textile Forum, you can reach every corner of the world.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Advertising and Partnership Opportunities: We offer a range of advertising and partnership options to help you grow your brand and reach a wider audience. Through strategic partnerships, we work to position you as one of the industry’s leading names.</span></p><p><br></p><p>Digital Transformation with Textile Forum!</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Our mission is to digitise the textile sector to meet the demands of modern trade. Textile Forum enables its users to grow their businesses, increase their engagement within the sector and offer innovative solutions.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Come and discover the benefits Textile Forum has to offer, and take your textile business a step further with the power of the digital world!</span></p><p><br></p><p>Join Us and Discover the Benefits of Textile Forum!</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>','2026-08-05 15:24:13','2026-08-05 15:24:13'),(170,'8cf04a9734132302f96da8e113e80ce5','EN-GB','Home','2026-08-05 15:24:13','2026-08-05 15:24:13'),(171,'9e66e6bd4069124578736528a0432752','EN-GB','About Us','2026-08-05 15:24:14','2026-08-05 15:24:14'),(172,'8691976c8aac39a26a8a343ccc759564','EN-GB','Advertisements','2026-08-05 15:24:14','2026-08-05 15:24:14'),(173,'d4781be85a6277a517748733f0b8d07a','EN-GB','Advertisements','2026-08-05 15:24:14','2026-08-05 15:24:14'),(174,'8bcef6472b9f8fd218edd263a6980a7a','EN-GB','Memberships','2026-08-05 15:24:15','2026-08-05 15:24:15'),(175,'15a5c892f04c0da637c9c41f99941c37','EN-GB','Corporate','2026-08-05 15:24:15','2026-08-05 15:24:15'),(176,'7effe80425095de4d5b996a01e4f00a3','EN-GB','Corporate','2026-08-05 15:24:15','2026-08-05 15:24:15'),(177,'38a295a2474b87513d9d7438054fdaf0','EN-GB','Terms and Conditions','2026-08-05 15:24:16','2026-08-05 15:24:16'),(178,'5d4eeacf3cbeb54cfc1f29e3f9e38bba','EN-GB','Privacy Policy','2026-08-05 15:24:16','2026-08-05 15:24:16'),(179,'d0aca993c8b8392c495be41eabba19ab','EN-GB','Data Protection Policy','2026-08-05 15:24:16','2026-08-05 15:24:16'),(180,'6cdb7124d4f3f9a7b88af1fbe3c12d00','EN-GB','Contact','2026-08-05 15:24:17','2026-08-05 15:24:17'),(181,'bbaff12800505b22a853e8b7f4eb6a22','EN-GB','Contact','2026-08-05 15:24:17','2026-08-05 15:24:17'),(182,'f2fdea440d768b85591e936a803c3631','EN-GB','Sign In','2026-08-05 15:24:17','2026-08-05 15:24:17'),(183,'c029d304cd267785a4a807a3073d5e1b','ZH','    <section class=\"text-editor-area\" data-padding-top=\"51\" data-padding-bottom=\"61\">\r\n        <div class=\"container-1440\">\r\n            <div class=\"row\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n                     <p>关于我们 - Textile Forum</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">纺织行业的创新力量</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum的诞生旨在推动纺织行业发生根本性变革。我们致力于将生产商、供应商、零售商和采购商汇聚于同一平台，从而提升行业内贸易的速度与效率。 通过Textileforum.net，我们正将纺织行业带入数字时代，并重新设计采购与销售流程。</span></p><p><br></p><p>Textile Forum 为何与众不同？</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">便捷高效的买卖交易：我们为用户提供了一个易于操作的平台，用户可轻松发布纺织品及服务信息。借助先进的搜索和筛选功能，只需点击几下，您就能找到心仪的产品。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">广泛的产品与分类范围：从面料到纺织机械，从时尚配饰到小众产品，我们为各类纺织品设有专门分类。我们为各行业的企业和个人提供全面的解决方案。</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">以信任为核心的交易：Textile Forum 采用用户评价和评论系统，致力于营造安全、透明的交易环境。通过了解商业伙伴的过往交易记录，您可以建立更安全的商业关系。</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">教育与信息资源：我们不仅是一个贸易平台，更是提供纺织行业最新资讯、教育内容及趋势分析的信息中心。在这里，您可以获取赢得竞争优势所需的一切信息。</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">全球市场准入：为促进国际贸易，我们提供多语言支持、汇率信息及物流指南。通过 Textile Forum，您可以触达世界各地。</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">广告与合作机会：我们提供多种广告和合作方案，助您拓展品牌影响力并触达更广泛的受众。通过战略合作，我们将致力于助您跻身行业领军者之列。</span></p><p><br></p><p>与Textile Forum携手实现数字化转型！</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">我们的使命是通过推动纺织行业的数字化转型，使其适应现代贸易的需求。Textile Forum 为用户提供拓展业务、增强行业互动以及获取创新解决方案的机会。</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">快来探索 Textile Forum 带来的这些专属权益，借助数字世界的力量，让您的纺织贸易更上一层楼！</span></p><p><br></p><p>加入我们，探索Textile Forum的独特优势！</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>','2026-08-05 15:24:36','2026-08-05 15:24:36'),(184,'7c2c1d4922b998b3287c1fe8804e3341','ZH','    <section class=\"text-editor-area\" data-padding-top=\"54\" data-padding-bottom=\"62\">\r\n        <div class=\"container-1440\">\r\n            <div class=\"row\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n                     <p><span style=\"color: var(--paragraph-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">条款与条件 - Textile Forum</span></p><p><br></p><p>1. 引言</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">本《条款与条件》适用于所有使用 Textileforum.net（以下简称“平台”）服务的用户。使用本平台即表示您已接受以下条款。如果您不同意这些条款，请勿使用本平台。</span></p><p><br></p><p>2. 服务定义</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum 是面向纺织行业的广告与交流平台。用户可在平台上发布广告，以销售、购买纺织产品或寻找供应商。Textile Forum 仅作为中介平台，绝不以任何形式成为商业交易的当事人。</span></p><p><br></p><p>3. 免责声明</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Textileforum.net 对平台上进行的任何商业交易或买卖均不承担责任。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 用户之间进行的所有交易均由各方自行承担责任。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Textile Forum 不保证用户输入信息的准确性，且对广告内容概不负责。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 通过本平台产生的任何争议均完全由用户自行解决，Textile Forum 无义务干预此类争议。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 用户同意，其在平台上进行的所有互动均由其自行承担风险。</span></p><p><br></p><p>4. 用户义务</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 用户同意依法使用本平台。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 用户有义务在其发布的广告中提供准确且完整的信息。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 用户承诺不会滥用平台。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 严禁从事任何损害Textile Forum品牌价值、具有误导性或旨在欺诈的活动。</span></p><p><br></p><p>5. 会员资格与账户安全</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 用户应对注册Textile Forum时提供的信息真实性负责。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 每位用户须自行负责账户安全。请勿允许第三方使用您的账户。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 如果您认为您的账户安全受到威胁，请立即联系Textile Forum。</span></p><p><br></p><p>6. 内容政策</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 用户不得在帖子中发布违反法律、具有误导性或违背公序良俗的内容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Textile Forum 保留审查平台发布内容的权利，并在认为必要时将其下架。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- 在平台上发布误导性或欺诈性帖子的用户，其账户可能会被暂停或彻底删除。</span></p><p><br></p><p>7. 第三方链接</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum 可能会在平台上提供指向第三方网站的链接。但 Textile Forum 对这些链接的内容和安全性不承担任何责任。用户访问第三方网站需自行承担风险。</span></p><p><br></p><p>8. 条款更新</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">本条款与条件可能由 Textile Forum 不时更新。用户有义务关注相关更新。更新后的条款自发布于平台之日起生效。</span></p><p><br></p><p>9. 联系方式</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">如果您对本条款和条件有任何疑问，请通过 info@textileforum.net 与我们联系。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum致力于为用户提供安全、高效的平台。但所有操作均由用户自行承担责任。我们建议您明智且安全地使用本平台。</span></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>','2026-08-05 15:25:07','2026-08-05 15:25:07'),(185,'7c2c1d4922b998b3287c1fe8804e3341','EN-GB','    <section class=\"text-editor-area\" data-padding-top=\"54\" data-padding-bottom=\"62\">\r\n        <div class=\"container-1440\">\r\n            <div class=\"row\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n                     <p><span style=\"color: var(--paragraph-color); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Terms and Conditions - Textile Forum</span></p><p><br></p><p>1. Introduction</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">These Terms and Conditions apply to all users of the services provided by Textileforum.net (hereinafter referred to as the ‘platform’). By using the platform, you agree to the following terms. If you do not agree to these terms, you must refrain from using the platform.</span></p><p><br></p><p>2. Description of the Service</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum is an advertising and communication platform for the textile sector. Users may post advertisements on the platform for the purpose of selling, purchasing or finding suppliers of textile products. Textile Forum acts solely as an intermediary and is in no way a party to any commercial transactions.</span></p><p><br></p><p>3. Disclaimer</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Textileforum.net accepts no liability for any commercial transactions or purchases carried out on the platform.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- All transactions between users are the sole responsibility of the parties involved.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Textile Forum does not guarantee the accuracy of information entered by users and cannot be held liable in any way for the content of listings.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Any disputes arising through the platform are entirely between the users themselves, and Textile Forum has no obligation to intervene in such disputes.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Users acknowledge that all interactions they carry out on the platform are at their own risk.</span></p><p><br></p><p>4. User Obligations</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Users agree to use the platform in accordance with the law.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Users are obliged to provide accurate and complete information in the listings they post.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Users undertake not to misuse the platform.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- It is strictly prohibited to engage in any activities that damage Textile Forum’s brand value, are misleading or constitute fraud.</span></p><p><br></p><p>5. Membership and Account Security</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Users are responsible for the accuracy of the information they provide when registering with Textile Forum.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Each user is responsible for their own account security. You must not allow third parties to use your account.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- If you believe your account security has been compromised, you must contact Textile Forum immediately.</span></p><p><br></p><p>6. Content Policy</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Users may not share content in their posts that is unlawful, misleading or immoral.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Textile Forum reserves the right to review content published on the platform and to remove it from publication where deemed necessary.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Users who post misleading or fraudulent listings on the platform may have their accounts suspended or permanently deleted.</span></p><p><br></p><p>7. Third-Party Links</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum may provide links to third-party websites on the platform. However, Textile Forum is not responsible for the content or security of these links. Users visit third-party sites at their own risk.</span></p><p><br></p><p>8. Updates to the Terms</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">These Terms and Conditions may be updated by Textile Forum from time to time. Users are obliged to keep abreast of any updates. Updated terms shall be deemed valid from the date they are published on the platform.</span></p><p><br></p><p>9. Contact</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">If you have any questions regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at info@textileforum.net.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum aims to provide users with a secure and effective platform. However, all transactions are the sole responsibility of the users. We recommend that you use our platform responsibly and safely.</span></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\n</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>','2026-08-05 15:25:14','2026-08-05 15:25:14'),(186,'3a9d651442af0379672cca505d4ac1a7','EN-GB','Post your ad','2026-08-05 15:25:14','2026-08-05 15:25:14'),(187,'4f6b6a8cea010ef371652fac819e7c2c','EN-GB','Denizli, Turkey','2026-08-05 15:25:14','2026-08-05 15:25:14'),(188,'a3650d4643f983f84e9ba87468c6661c','EN-GB','Categories','2026-08-05 15:25:15','2026-08-05 15:25:15'),(189,'82e992bc5848267a1ef6f2f9ff187991','EN-GB','Home Textiles','2026-08-05 15:25:15','2026-08-05 15:25:15'),(190,'b1a531f35b33e172079bdb8b032f9e70','EN-GB','Textile Materials','2026-08-05 15:25:16','2026-08-05 15:25:16'),(191,'d86ed4120c75acb0b9eb817680373e85','EN-GB','Textile Machinery','2026-08-05 15:25:16','2026-08-05 15:25:16'),(192,'e8af82a77d731f44f877ade5d12474c8','EN-GB','Weaving Machines','2026-08-05 15:25:16','2026-08-05 15:25:16'),(193,'89fedbf5cb48ce4e766548c97eb23e64','EN-GB','Wholesale Buying and Selling','2026-08-05 15:25:17','2026-08-05 15:25:17'),(194,'a7e79f408c4aa7f210ea7ef96cce53f7','EN-GB','Wholesale Children’s Clothing','2026-08-05 15:25:17','2026-08-05 15:25:17'),(195,'330c91d9cb2e8f041a92691ce182e7b3','EN-GB','Wholesale Women’s Clothing','2026-08-05 15:25:17','2026-08-05 15:25:17'),(196,'7f15e4e3f0983a0a2b71b617a080c184','EN-GB','Wholesale Men’s Clothing','2026-08-05 15:25:18','2026-08-05 15:25:18'),(197,'2d84d55559bf925ed085cd2de946d05c','EN-GB','Terms &amp; Conditions','2026-08-05 15:25:18','2026-08-05 15:25:18'),(198,'0842f0b5e65d7da42b9ada5696dae322','EN-GB','Help &amp; Support','2026-08-05 15:25:19','2026-08-05 15:25:19'),(199,'0781cc2839dec7f44c2972dd88face51','EN-GB','Security Notice','2026-08-05 15:25:19','2026-08-05 15:25:19'),(200,'fe212eb6da94dc3f533495821a91e31b','EN-GB','    <section class=\"text-editor-area\" data-padding-top=\"53\" data-padding-bottom=\"63\">\r\n        <div class=\"container-1440\">\r\n            <div class=\"row\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n                     <p>Privacy Policy - Textile Forum</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">As the Textile Forum family, we take your privacy seriously. This policy explains the information we collect, process and use whilst you are using Textileforum.net. By using our platform, you are deemed to have accepted this policy.</span></p><p><br></p><p>1. Information We Collect and How We Use It</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">We collect certain information to enable you to post adverts on Textile Forum and communicate with other members:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p>Personal Information:<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> Basic details such as your first name, surname, email address and telephone number.</span></p><p>Advertisement Information:<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> Descriptions, images and contact details you share in your advertisements.</span></p><p>Account Information:<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> Information required for account management, such as your username and password.</span></p><p>Technical Data:<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> Technical details such as your IP address, the browser you use and the times you access the site.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">This information is used to improve your experience of using the platform, to ensure security and to enhance the quality of service provided by Textile Forum.</span></p><p><br></p><p>2. Sharing and Visibility of Information</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Information you share in your listings is visible to other users of the platform. For example, if you have included your telephone number or email address, other users will be able to access this information. How you choose to share your information is up to you, but we advise you to exercise caution in this regard. We may share your information in response to a request from a public authority, in accordance with legal requirements.</span></p><p><br></p><p>3. Data Security</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We do our utmost to ensure the security of your user information. In particular, your account passwords are never stored in plain text (in a readable format) on our systems. Your passwords are protected using the strongest encryption algorithms (hash functions) in accordance with industry standards; this ensures that no one, not even system administrators, can view your password. However, we would like to remind you that sharing data over the internet is not entirely secure. Please bear in mind that the information you share when creating your listings may be publicly visible.<br><br></span></p><p>4. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textileforum.net uses cookies to provide you with a better experience. </span></p><p>Cookies:</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">They preserve your session information.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Remember your personal preferences.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Analyses platform usage.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">You can change your cookie settings in your browser, but some services depend on cookies being enabled.</span></p><p><br></p><p>5. User Rights</p><p>On the Textile Forum, you can:</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">View, edit or delete your account details.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">You can update or remove your posts.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">You can request information about how your personal data is used.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">If you have any questions regarding privacy or data security, please contact us at info@textileforum.net.</span></p><p><br></p><p>6. Policy Updates</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Our privacy policy may change over time. It is your responsibility to keep track of any updates. The updated policy comes into effect when it is published on Textileforum.net.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">At Textile Forum, we aim to provide a secure and transparent trading environment. We encourage you to be mindful of how you share your information.</span></p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>','2026-08-05 15:25:26','2026-08-05 15:25:26'),(201,'4d3e223e8fdecb815b79b54d9808fde3','EN-GB','Newsletter','2026-08-05 15:25:26','2026-08-05 15:25:26'),(202,'7742bd10d2057b46c46f4fd77e627387','EN-GB','Be the first to find out about our weekly news, offers and events. Cancel your subscription whenever you like with just one click.','2026-08-05 15:25:27','2026-08-05 15:25:27'),(203,'a4d3b161ce1309df1c4e25df28694b7b','EN-GB','Submit','2026-08-05 15:25:27','2026-08-05 15:25:27'),(204,'f775ad1fbb08939178d4df9c457601f2','EN-GB','Your Email Address','2026-08-05 15:25:28','2026-08-05 15:25:28'),(205,'daa3af6ce23ff059f430c68cb5483286','EN-GB','Copyright {copy} {year} Textile Forum. All rights reserved.','2026-08-05 15:25:28','2026-08-05 15:25:28'),(206,'92582eacd361ebe6e6d1c580efd9667a','EN-GB','Please enter a search term.','2026-08-05 15:25:28','2026-08-05 15:25:28'),(207,'b6f0b7d0a4e5e260756b14e02f73a36c','EN-GB','Thanks to Subscription Us.','2026-08-05 15:25:29','2026-08-05 15:25:29'),(208,'37096d4c09162577c84ef58296a375f8','EN-GB','Submitting','2026-08-05 15:25:29','2026-08-05 15:25:29'),(209,'3547f154a9d0bbdb6a7dad0606c2e4fb','EN-GB','    <section class=\"text-editor-area\" data-padding-top=\"51\" data-padding-bottom=\"59\">\r\n        <div class=\"container-1440\">\r\n            <div class=\"row\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-12\">\r\n                     <p>Data Protection Act (KVKK) Information Notice</p><p><br></p><p>1. Introduction</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">As Textile Forum, we attach great importance to the protection of our users’ personal data in accordance with the Law on the Protection of Personal Data No. 6698 (“KVKK”). This notice has been prepared to explain the purposes for which the personal data of individuals using the Textileforum.net platform is processed, how it is stored, and the methods used to protect it.</span></p><p><br></p><p>2. Purposes of Processing Personal Data</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">The personal data we collect from our users is processed for the following purposes:</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Creating and managing user accounts,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Providing users with a service for publishing advertisements,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Facilitating communication between users,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Enhancing the security of the platform and preventing fraud,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Carrying out analysis and statistical studies to improve the user experience,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Using data for marketing activities where explicit consent has been obtained for the sending of commercial electronic communications,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Complying with legal obligations.</span></p><p><br></p><p>3. Personal Data Processed</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">The personal data processed on our platform are as follows:</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Identification Information: First name, surname</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Contact details: Telephone number, email address</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Account details: Username, password</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Listing Information: Content added by the user (photographs, descriptions, etc.)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Technical Data: IP address, device information, cookies</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">When users share their contact details (telephone number, email, etc.) whilst posting a listing, they acknowledge that this information may be viewed by other users.</span></p><p><br></p><p>4. Method of Collection and Legal Basis for Personal Data</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Personal data is collected automatically or manually whilst users register with Textileforum.net, post listings or use the platform. These processes are carried out on the following legal grounds, as set out in Articles 5 and 6 of the Personal Data Protection Act (KVKK):</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Where expressly provided for by law,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Necessity for the conclusion or performance of a contract,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Fulfilment of our legal obligations,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- Obtaining the data subject’s explicit consent.</span></p><p><br></p><p>5. Retention Period for Personal Data</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Personal data is retained for as long as is necessary for the purpose of processing. Once the retention period has expired, the relevant data is erased, destroyed or anonymised in accordance with the provisions of the Personal Data Protection Act (KVKK) and other relevant legislation.</span></p><p><br></p><p>6. Sharing of Personal Data with Third Parties</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum shares its users’ personal data with third parties only in the following circumstances:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- With public authorities for the purpose of fulfilling legal obligations,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- With business partners, where the user has given their explicit consent,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- With service providers offering infrastructure and technical services.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum does not sell users’ personal data to third parties for marketing or commercial purposes.</span></p><p><br></p><p>7. Users’ Rights</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Under the Personal Data Protection Act (KVKK), users have the following rights:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- To find out whether their personal data is being processed,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- To request information regarding such processing,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- To request the rectification of their personal data if it has been processed inaccurately or incompletely,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- To request the erasure or destruction of the processed data,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- To request to be informed regarding the rectification or erasure of data where it has been shared with third parties,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- To object to data analysed by automated systems,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">- To claim compensation if you have suffered damage as a result of the unlawful processing of your personal data.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Users wishing to exercise these rights may contact Textile Forum via *info@textileforum.net*.</span></p><p><br></p><p>8. Security Measures</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Textile Forum takes appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure the confidentiality and security of personal data. However, it should be borne in mind that there is no absolute guarantee of security for data transmissions over the internet.</span></p><p><br></p><p>9. Updates to the Data Protection Notice</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">This Data Protection Notice may be updated in the event of changes to legislation or to Textile Forum’s data processing policies. The updated text shall be deemed valid from the date of its publication on the platform.</span></p><p><br></p><p>Contact:</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">If you have any questions or requests relating to the KVKK, please contact us at info@textileforum.net.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">At Textile Forum, we prioritise the security of your personal data and are committed to providing a transparent and reliable service.</span></p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>','2026-08-05 15:25:35','2026-08-05 15:25:35'),(210,'caa38afa0f126460be57495185d30a51','TR','<!-- top Listings  S t a r t -->\r\n<section class=\"featureListing\" data-padding-top=\"50\" data-padding-bottom=\"50\" style=\"background-color:\">\r\n    <div class=\"container-1440\">\r\n        <div class=\"titleWithBtn d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-40\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"head3\"> Dokuma Makinaları</h2>\r\n            <form id=\"filter_with_listing_page_category_wise_listing\" action=\"http://localhost/ilanlar\" method=\"get\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"cat\" value=\"38\"/>\r\n                 \r\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"submit_form_listing_filter_category_wise_listing see-all\">