r music lovers and audiophiles. Designed for ultimate comfort, they feature soft ear cups and an adjustable headband for a perfect fit. With up to 20 hours of playtime on a single charge, they are ideal for long listening sessions. Compatible with all Bluetooth-enabled devices, including smartphones, tablets, and laptops. Don&#x27;t miss out on this fantastic deal – get your Anker Sound Core R500 today!','2026-08-19 09:06:30','2026-08-19 09:06:30'),(1039,'f76f3035354d8a29bd9b40c877024920','EN-GB','Lenovo IdeaCentre A540','2026-08-19 09:06:30','2026-08-19 09:06:30'),(1040,'b5a9cf2643406ddc65894f379523ea0f','EN-GB','Discover the power and elegance of the Lenovo IdeaCentre A540 All-in-One Computer. This sleek and stylish device features a stunning 23.8-inch or 27-inch QHD display, delivering crystal-clear visuals for work and entertainment. Powered by the latest Intel processors, it ensures smooth and efficient performance for multitasking. The integrated high-quality speakers and smart wireless charging pad add convenience and functionality. Perfect for any home or office, the IdeaCentre A540 combines cutting-edge technology with sophisticated design.','2026-08-19 09:06:30','2026-08-19 09:06:30'),(1041,'136b12e68d301c1ff5386208cfd936fb','EN-GB','Apple Reconditioned No Scratch Laptop','2026-08-19 09:06:30','2026-08-19 09:06:30'),(1042,'d1a4921d79c4208f3761301a7e855a1e','EN-GB','Mobvoi TicWatch Pro 3 Ultra GPS','2026-08-19 09:06:30','2026-08-19 09:06:30'),(1043,'972051ad593b6a5fc626a93f366b0048','EN-GB','EHS-18CRN|NEW Elite 1.5 Ton Split AC','2026-08-19 09:06:30','2026-08-19 09:06:30'),(1044,'b97e1d1d4a1f105213533ce84cedd295','EN-GB','Introducing the EHS-18CRN, the latest addition to our Elite series of Split Air Conditioners, designed to redefine your cooling experience. With a powerful cooling capacity of 1.5 tons, this AC ensures efficient and effective cooling even in large spaces. Equipped with advanced features like Turbo Cooling and Sleep Mode, it offers customiz