d Persian Cats for sale','2026-08-19 09:06:36','2026-08-19 09:06:36'),(1087,'dab3a09322f16b95af819d99c26a2eff','EN-GB','Purebred Persian Cats for sale! These elegant felines boast luxurious, long fur that is soft to the touch. Known for their calm and affectionate nature, Persian cats make wonderful companions for any family. Our kittens are raised in a loving environment and are well-socialized. With their stunning beauty and gentle demeanor, owning a Purebred Persian Cat is a true joy. Don&#x27;t miss out on the opportunity to welcome one of these regal creatures into your home!','2026-08-19 09:06:36','2026-08-19 09:06:36'),(1088,'17acfe3815bc60ab891545bdb3b214cd','EN-GB','Hisense Washing Machine','2026-08-19 09:06:36','2026-08-19 09:06:36'),(1089,'f69e9fedf89182b9c726f894e3d459ba','EN-GB','The Hisense washing machine offers a powerful and efficient cleaning experience. With a variety of wash programs and settings, this machine can handle all your laundry needs. Its spacious drum capacity allows you to wash large loads in one go, saving you time and energy. The machine is built with durability in mind, ensuring long-lasting performance. Plus, its sleek design adds a modern touch to your laundry room.','2026-08-19 09:06:36','2026-08-19 09:06:36'),(1090,'9b970f3cdd5deb397e04f9876b150e56','EN-GB','Daewoo 700W microwave','2026-08-19 09:06:36','2026-08-19 09:06:36'),(1091,'7ce3be8e685df9ce0977d5b336c2d9a6','EN-GB','Upgrade your kitchen with the Daewoo 700W microwave, delivering efficient cooking power in a compact design. With its 700 watts of cooking power, this microwave quickly heats up your meals, snacks, and beverages. Its user-friendly interface and intuitive controls make cooking a breeze. Sleek and stylish, it complements any kitchen decor. Don&#x27;t compromise on quality and convenience—experience the reliability of Daewoo today','2026-08-19 09:06:36','2026-08-19 09:06:36'),(1092,'a020dcdae5446c24147db3002f072c37','EN-GB','Tuitions and Coaching Classes','2026-08-19 09:06:36','2026-08-19 09:06:36'),(1093,'658b0b7c7b55c4da30142390ffde7013','EN-GB','Subject Specialization: Find specialized tuitions and coaching classes catering to a wide range of subjects, from mathematics and science to languages and humanities.Qualified Instructors: Connect with experienced and qualified instructors who provide personalized guidance and support to help students excel academically.Flexible Learning Options: Discover flexible learning options, including in-person classes, online sessions, and hybrid models, designed to accommodate diverse schedules and learning preferences.Exam Preparation: Access comprehensive exam preparation courses tailored for standardized tests, competitive exams, and school/college-level assessments to boost confidence and performance.Enhanced Learning Environment: Immerse yourself in an enriched learning environment that fosters critical thinking, problem-solving skills, and academic excellence, empowering students to reach their full potential.','2026-08-19 09:06:36','2026-08-19 09:06:36'),(1094,'c1050b2b86eb568d6681a09897a6e23b','EN-GB','FluentSpeak - Master Spoken English and IELTS Training','2026-08-19 09:06:36','2026-08-19 09:06:36'),(1095,'b38703786856d9ae46fa2062458ecc2b','EN-GB','FluentSpeak offers comprehensive Spoken English and IELTS training programs designed to equip learners with the language skills and confidence needed to excel in both personal and professional settings. Our expert instructors employ immersive teaching methodologies, interactive sessions, and personalized feedback to enhance speaking, listening, reading, and writing abilities. Whether you&#x27;re aiming for academic success, career advancement, or migration purposes, our tailored curriculum ensures targeted preparation for the IELTS exam, including intensive practice sessions and test-taking strategies. With small class sizes and flexible schedules, FluentSpeak accommodates diverse learning needs and preferences, fostering a supportive and conducive learning environment. Join FluentSpeak today and unlock your potential to communicate fluently, expressively, and effectively in English, opening doors to a world of opportunities.','2026-08-19 09:06:36','2026-08-19 09:06:36'),(1096,'d72d0ba079609bb55f9c390bab80bc24','EN-GB','Spoken English','2026-08-19 09:06:37','2026-08-19 09:06:37'),(1097,'956c4c3b84093e72813219a16586f4ee','EN-GB','FluentSpeak offers dynamic Spoken English training programs tailored to enhance your communication skills and fluency. Our experienced instructors utilize engaging lessons, interactive exercises, and real-life simulations to build confidence in speaking, listening, and pronunciation. Whether you&#x27;re a beginner looking to start from scratch or an advanced learner aiming for fluency, our curriculum caters to all proficiency levels. With a focus on practical conversation, our classes empower you to navigate everyday situations, professional settings, and social interactions with ease. Join FluentSpeak and embark on a journey to articulate your thoughts, express yourself confidently, and connect with others effectively in English. Unlock the language of opportunity and broaden your horizons with FluentSpeak&#x27;s Spoken English program.','2026-08-19 09:06:37','2026-08-19 09:06:37'),(1098,'e42c0730db138280e1d272a300e7a5b6','EN-GB','Wanderlust Book For Sell','2026-08-19 09:06:37','2026-08-19 09:06:37'),(1099,'0dd72ff3f88947e5b7539df672ffdd7b','EN-GB','Embark on a captivating voyage through history with &quot;Wanderlust Wonders,&quot; an immersive travel book that transports readers to ancient civilizations and distant lands. From the majestic pyramids of Egypt to the serene temples of Kyoto, explore the world&#x27;s most iconic landmarks and hidden gems through vivid descriptions and stunning photography. Immerse yourself in the rich tapestry of cultures, traditions, and stories that have shaped our global heritage. Join us on this unforgettable expedition and uncover the wonders of the past waiting to be discovered.','2026-08-19 09:06:37','2026-08-19 09:06:37'),(1100,'265e154bbc23f7f5a2591f3634a275c4','EN-GB','Discover Kids&#x27; Musical Instruments','2026-08-19 09:06:37','2026-08-19 09:06:37'),(1101,'7fc6f110e01d211dd03dcec4c9dc20cc','EN-GB','Harmony Haven&quot; is a whimsical collection of musical instruments tailored for young maestros. From colorful xylophones to playful tambourines, each instrument is crafted to inspire creativity and cultivate a love for music. Designed with safety and durability in mind, our instruments are perfect for little hands to explore rhythm and melody. Spark your child&#x27;s imagination and foster a lifelong passion for music with &quot;Harmony Haven&quot; – where every note is a step towards musical mastery.','2026-08-19 09:06:37','2026-08-19 09:06:37'),(1102,'55068d1607ca5f5a3833abb6af9d91d4','EN-GB','Women&#x27;s jeans pant','2026-08-19 09:06:37','2026-08-19 09:06:37'),(1103,'38da40c4635be1ef0d1e0e70f64a5a94','EN-GB','Indulge in the perfect fit with our range of women&#x27;s jeans pants, available in a variety of sizes to suit every body type. From petite to plus-size, we offer a diverse selection crafted to flatter your curves and enhance your style. Whether you prefer skinny, bootcut, or boyfriend styles, our jeans are designed for comfort and confidence. Explore our collection and find your ideal pair to elevate your everyday look effortlessly.','2026-08-19 09:06:37','2026-08-19 09:06:37'),(1104,'73b3fd8df25c89cae893b0a278143a21','EN-GB','Women&#x27;s jeans pants winter','2026-08-19 09:06:37','2026-08-19 09:06:37'),(1105,'850143b9c91c541007d6919026fba6c6','EN-GB','LG 22-inch LED TV','2026-08-19 09:06:37','2026-08-19 09:06:37'),(1106,'3de228ca1b8e91c08459f19d69e973df','EN-GB','Experience big entertainment in a compact package with the LG LED TV 22-inch. Perfect for small spaces, dorm rooms, or kitchens, this sleek TV delivers vibrant visuals and crisp sound for an immersive viewing experien