w-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; margin-top: 1.25em; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Transform your space with the elegance and comfort of our premium chair. Elevate your seating experience and indulge in luxury every day. Order now and experience the difference!\"</p>','343','344|342',NULL,1300,0,'new','refurbished','+494915510686794',0,0,'Berlin, Germany',52.5200066,13.4049540,1,550,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:17','2024-05-01 01:21:48','2025-01-30 20:24:17'),(7,1,NULL,3,12,NULL,NULL,9,NULL,NULL,'Exquisite Luxury: Corner & 2+3 Seater Sofa Collection','exquisite-luxury-corner-2-3-seater-sofa-collection','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-family: Söhne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Discover ultimate comfort and sophistication with our exquisite collection of luxury corner and 2+3 seater sofas. Crafted with precision and attention to detail, each piece embodies elegance and refinement, elevating your living space to new heights of luxury. Sink into sumptuous cushions and experience unparalleled relaxation as you unwind after a long day. Our corner sofas offer versatility, maximizing your living room space, while the 2+3 seater sets provide ample seating for family and guests. Choose from a range of premium fabrics and finishes to complement your interior décor effortlessly. Whether you prefer classic designs or modern aesthetics, our collection caters to every style preference. Indulge in the epitome of luxury living with our meticulously curated selection of sofas, designed to enhance your home\'s ambiance and make a statement of sophistication</span><br></p>','346','350|349|348|347',NULL,1200,1,'new','original','+12013514000',0,0,'Chicago, United States',41.8538521,-87.6378814,1,1294,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:17','2024-05-01 09:27:26','2025-01-30 20:24:17'),(8,1,NULL,1,1,2,12,1,NULL,NULL,'Honda Jazz I-VTEC SI','honda-jazz-i-vtec-si','<h2 class=\"css-9hen01 ew0ql603\" style=\"line-height: 1; color: rgb(60, 50, 65); letter-spacing: 0.01em; font-size: 24px; padding-top: 8px; font-family: Inter, HelveticaNeue-Light, &quot;Helvetica Neue Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-size: 14px;\">Efficiency meets elegance in the Honda Jazz I-VTEC SI. With its sleek design and advanced I-VTEC engine, this car promises a dynamic driving experience. Whether navigating city streets or cruising on the highway, its nimble handling and responsive acceleration ensure a smooth ride. Inside, you\'ll find a spacious and comfortable cabin, packed with innovative features for both convenience and entertainment. From its bold exterior to its intuitive interior, the Honda Jazz I-VTEC SI is a perfect blend of style and functionality</span><br></h2>','351','353|352',NULL,11999,1,'used','original','+12013514000',0,0,'Chicago, United States',41.8781136,-87.6297982,1,1060,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:17','2024-05-01 22:45:28','2025-01-30 20:24:17'),(9,1,NULL,1,2,NULL,5,1,NULL,NULL,'2021 Audi A3 35 TDI S Line','2021-audi-a3-35-tdi-s-line','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(60, 50, 65); font-family: Inter, HelveticaNeue-Light, &quot;Helvetica Neue Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">1 Owner From New - Uniting Design And Sophisticated Technology, The Innovative A3 Awaits Your Test Drive Experience In-Store. - 18 Inch Alloy Wheels, Led Headlights, Front Sport Seats, Cloth And Leather Upholstery, Sport Suspension, Leather Trimmed Multifuction Steering Wheel, Black Cloth Headlining, Storage Pack, 12V Power Socket, Audi Drive Select, Heated Door Mirrors, Air Conditioning, Split Folding Rear Seat, Audi Smartphone Interface, 7 Inch Colour Display, Dab Digital Radio, Bluetooth Wireless Smartphone Connectivity, Auxilliary Input, Usb Ports, Cruise Control, Rear Radar Type Parking Sensors, Hill Hold Assist, Rain Sensing Windscreen Wipers, Isofix, Dusk Sensing Automatic Headlights, Date Of First Registration June 2021. - Drive Into A Low Emissions Zone With This Euro 6, ULEZ &amp; CAZ Compliant Car - We\'re An Rac Approved Dealer, All Vehicles Come With A Full Multipoint Check &amp; Warranty. We Want Your Car! Quick &amp; Easy, Trade In Or Sell.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(60, 50, 65); font-family: Inter, HelveticaNeue-Light, &quot;Helvetica Neue Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.15px;\"></p>','293','294|278|275',NULL,1000,1,'used','original','+12013514000',0,0,'New York, United States',40.7127753,-74.0059728,0,637,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:17','2024-05-01 23:00:26','2025-01-30 20:24:17'),(10,1,NULL,4,16,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,'Hair pack for dandruff+ 4 freebies','hair-pack-for-dandruff-4-freebies','<p><div class=\"css-1qfzbsu e1pt9h6u9\" style=\"display: flex; -webkit-box-pack: justify; justify-content: space-between; width: 880px; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center; color: rgb(60, 50, 65); font-family: Inter, HelveticaNeue-Light, &quot;Helvetica Neue Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.15px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span class=\"css-1n9ogs6 e1pt9h6u7\" style=\"display: flex; -webkit-box-pack: center; justify-content: center; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center; color: rgb(0, 127, 176);\"></span></div></p><h1 data-q=\"vip-title\" class=\"css-4rz76v e1pt9h6u5\" style=\"font-weight: 600; line-height: 32px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(60, 50, 65); letter-spacing: 0.01em; font-size: 24px; font-family: Inter, HelveticaNeue-Light, &quot;Helvetica Neue Light&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><p style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: var(--base-aa); margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 26px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 14px; font-family: Muli, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(61, 70, 67); letter-spacing: normal;\">Have you ever considered using avocado oil for dry scalp? A dry scalp is one of the most frustrating things you can deal with. It’s itching and irritating, it makes your hair look bad, and it can cause dandruff.</p></h1>','359','358|357',NULL,514,1,'used',NULL,'+8801799328264',0,0,'Dhaka, Bangladesh',23.7820624,90.4160527,1,214,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:17','2024-05-01 23:06:12','2025-01-30 20:24:17'),(11,1,NULL,2,10,NULL,6,2,NULL,NULL,'Anker Sound Core R500 Bluetooth Headphone','anker-sound-core-r500-bluetooth-headphone','<p>Experience unparalleled audio quality with the Anker Sound Core R500 Bluetooth Headphones. These headphones deliver crisp, clear sound with powerful bass, making them perfect for music lovers and audiophiles. Designed for ultimate comfort, they feature soft ear cups and an adjustable headband for a perfect fit. With up to 20 hours of playtime on a single charge, they are ideal for long listening sessions. Compatible with all Bluetooth-enabled devices, including smartphones, tablets, and laptops. Don\'t miss out on this fantastic deal – get your Anker Sound Core R500 today!<br></p>','684','685|683',NULL,100,1,'new','original','+8801799328264',0,0,'Dhaka, Bangladesh',23.7947536,90.4143085,1,511,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:17','2024-05-01 23:11:06','2025-01-30 20:24:17'),(12,NULL,1,2,7,NULL,5,6,NULL,NULL,'Lenovo IdeaCentre A540','lenovo-ideacentre-a540','Discover the power and elegance of the Lenovo IdeaCentre A540 All-in-One Computer. This sleek and stylish device features a stunning 23.8-inch or 27-inch QHD display, delivering crystal-clear visuals for work and entertainment. Powered by the latest Intel processors, it ensures smooth and efficient performance for multitasking. The integrated high-quality speakers and smart wireless charging pad add convenience and functionality. Perfect for any home or office, the IdeaCentre A540 combines cutting-edge technology with sophisticated design.','764','763|762',NULL,200,1,'new','original','+8801799328264',0,0,'ঢাকা, Bangladesh',22.5743545,88.3628734,1,269,1,1,'2024-05-29 06:31:42','2025-01-30 20:26:20','2024-05-02 04:16:00','2025-01-30 20:26:20'),(13,24,NULL,2,8,6,1,26,NULL,NULL,'Apple Reconditioned No Scratch Laptop','dell-reconditioned-no-scratch-laptop','Introducing the Mobvoi TicWatch Pro 3 Ultra GPS, the ultimate smartwatch that redefines performance and versatility. Powered by the latest Qualcomm Snapdragon Wear 4100 platform, it delivers lightning-fast performance and enhanced energy efficiency for seamless multitasking and extended battery life. With built-in Ultra GPS technology, this smartwatch provides precise location tracking and navigation, perfect for outdoor enthusiasts and fitness enthusiasts alike. Featuring a dual-layer display with AMOLED and FSTN panels, it offers exceptional clarity and visibility in any lighting condition while conserving battery life. The TicWatch Pro 3 Ultra GPS boasts a comprehensive suite of health and fitness tracking features, including heart rate monitoring, sleep tracking, and blood oxygen saturation measurement, empowering you to take control of your well-being. Stay connected on the go with notifications, calls, and apps directly from your wrist, making it the ultimate companion for your active lifestyle. Dive into a world of endless possibilities with the Mobvoi TicWatch Pro 3 Ultra GPS – where innovation meets performance.<br>','745','746|744|743|382',NULL,145,1,'new',NULL,'+8801799328264',0,0,'ঢাকা, Bangladesh',23.8040930,90.4152376,0,229,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:17','2024-05-08 08:19:38','2025-01-30 20:24:17'),(14,24,NULL,4,18,NULL,3,6,NULL,NULL,'Mobvoi TicWatch Pro 3 Ultra GPS','mobvoi-ticwatch-pro-3-ultra-gps','Introducing the Mobvoi TicWatch Pro 3 Ultra GPS, the ultimate smartwatch that redefines performance and versatility. Powered by the latest Qualcomm Snapdragon Wear 4100 platform, it delivers lightning-fast performance and enhanced energy efficiency for seamless multitasking and extended battery life. With built-in Ultra GPS technology, this smartwatch provides precise location tracking and navigation, perfect for outdoor enthusiasts and fitness enthusiasts alike. Featuring a dual-layer display with AMOLED and FSTN panels, it offers exceptional clarity and visibility in any lighting condition while conserving battery life. The TicWatch Pro 3 Ultra GPS boasts a comprehensive suite of health and fitness tracking features, including heart rate monitoring, sleep tracking, and blood oxygen saturation measurement, empowering you to take control of your well-being. Stay connected on the go with notifications, calls, and apps directly from your wrist, making it the ultimate companion for your active lifestyle. Dive into a world of endless possibilities with the Mobvoi TicWatch Pro 3 Ultra GPS – where innovation meets performance.','407',NULL,NULL,250,1,'new','original','+8801799328264',0,0,'Dhaka, Bangladesh',23.8701988,90.4233984,1,99,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:13','2024-05-08 08:23:17','2025-01-30 20:24:13'),(15,24,NULL,2,11,NULL,5,5,NULL,NULL,'EHS-18CRN|NEW Elite 1.5 Ton Split AC','ehs-18crn-new-elite-1-5-ton-split-ac','Introducing the EHS-18CRN, the latest addition to our Elite series of Split Air Conditioners, designed to redefine your cooling experience. With a powerful cooling capacity of 1.5 tons, this AC ensures efficient and effective cooling even in large spaces. Equipped with advanced features like Turbo Cooling and Sleep Mode, it offers customizable comfort to suit your preferences throughout the day and night. The sleek and modern design of the Elite series adds a touch of sophistication to any room décor. Experience whisper-quiet operation, thanks to its low noise levels, allowing you to relax without disturbance. With energy-saving capabilities, this AC not only keeps you cool but also reduces your electricity bills. Stay cool and comfortable all summer long with the EHS-18CRN Elite 1.5 Ton Split AC','406','406',NULL,500,1,'new','original','+8801799328264',0,0,'Dhaka, Bangladesh',23.7931750,90.4071831,1,282,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:13','2024-05-08 08:24:18','2025-01-30 20:24:13'),(16,0,NULL,1,2,NULL,3,7,NULL,NULL,'fsd sdf sd fsdf sd fsd fsgdfg df gfg d','fsd-sdf-sd-fsdf-sd-fsd-fsgdfg-df-gfg-d','<input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"custom-check-box\" id=\"item-condition\" style=\"border-color: var(--main-color-one); background: var(--main-color-one);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 112, 133); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><label for=\"item-condition\" style=\"font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\">This item has Condition</label><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"custom-check-box\" id=\"item-condition\" style=\"border-color: var(--main-color-one); background: var(--main-color-one);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 112, 133); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><label for=\"item-condition\" style=\"font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\">This item has Condition</label><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"custom-check-box\" id=\"item-condition\" style=\"border-color: var(--main-color-one); background: var(--main-color-one);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 112, 133); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><label for=\"item-condition\" style=\"font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\">This item has Condition</label><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"custom-check-box\" id=\"item-condition\" style=\"border-color: var(--main-color-one); background: var(--main-color-one);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 112, 133); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><label for=\"item-condition\" style=\"font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\">This item has Condition</label><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"custom-check-box\" id=\"item-condition