L,9,29,NULL,1,21,NULL,NULL,'Apple Latest Headphones','apple-latest-headphones','<p>Apple\'s latest headphones deliver unparalleled audio performance with rich, immersive sound. Equipped with advanced drivers and adaptive EQ, they ensure every note is clear and precise.<br></p>','699','701|700',NULL,500,0,'new','original','+8801799328264',0,0,'Dhaka, Bangladesh',23.7956037,90.3536548,0,276,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:13','2024-06-10 15:36:51','2025-01-30 20:24:13'),(71,1,NULL,9,30,NULL,3,12,NULL,NULL,'Samsung Galaxy A50','samsung-galaxy-a50','<p><strong>Powerful Performance</strong>: Experience lightning-fast speeds with the latest Snapdragon processor, ideal for multitasking and gaming.</p><p><strong>Stunning Display</strong>: Enjoy vibrant visuals on a 6.7-inch AMOLED screen with a smooth 120Hz refresh rate.</p><p><strong>Pro-Grade Camera</strong>: Capture every moment with a quad-camera system featuring a 108MP main sensor for incredible detail and clarity.</p><p><strong>Long-Lasting Battery</strong>: Stay powered all day with a 5000mAh battery and fast charging capabilities.</p><p><strong>Advanced Connectivity</strong>: Benefit from 5G and Wi-Fi 6 support for seamless and rapid connectivity.</p><p>Don\'t miss out on the Samsung Galaxy S50 – your ultimate smartphone upgrade!</p>','703','705|704|702',NULL,2500,1,NULL,'original','+41791235784',0,0,'Ridgeland, United States',32.4276903,-81.0087199,1,1,1,1,NULL,'2024-06-11 08:27:20','2024-06-10 16:07:57','2024-06-11 08:27:20'),(72,2,NULL,6,37,NULL,NULL,24,NULL,NULL,'Week Old Kitten','week-old-kitten','<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.82); font-family: &quot;DM Sans&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">for sale! This adorable fluff ball is looking for a loving home. They are playful, cuddly, and full of energy. Their soft fur and sweet purrs will melt your heart. Don\'t miss out on adding this precious little one to your family! Contact us for more information.</span><br></p>','709','708|707',NULL,1199,0,NULL,NULL,'+8801799328264',0,0,'Dhaka, Bangladesh',23.7661639,90.3588734,1,125,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:13','2024-06-11 00:52:14','2025-01-30 20:24:13'),(73,2,NULL,6,37,NULL,NULL,5,NULL,NULL,'Purebred Persian Cats for sale','purebred-persian-cats-for-sale','<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.82); font-family: &quot;DM Sans&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">Purebred Persian Cats for sale! These elegant felines boast luxurious, long fur that is soft to the touch. Known for their calm and affectionate nature, Persian cats make wonderful companions for any family. Our kittens are raised in a loving environment and are well-socialized. With their stunning beauty and gentle demeanor, owning a Purebred Persian Cat is a true joy. Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to welcome one of these regal creatures into your home!</span><br></p>','710','711|712',NULL,300,0,NULL,NULL,'+8801799328264',0,0,'Dhaka, Bangladesh',23.7612256,90.4207660,0,91,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:13','2024-06-11 01:00:01','2025-01-30 20:24:13'),(74,2,NULL,7,42,NULL,5,5,NULL,NULL,'Hisense Washing Machine','hisense-washing-machine','<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.82); font-family: &quot;DM Sans&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">The Hisense washing machine offers a powerful and efficient cleaning experience. With a variety of wash programs and settings, this machine can handle all your laundry needs. Its spacious drum capacity allows you to wash large loads in one go, saving you time and energy. The machine is built with durability in mind, ensuring long-lasting performance. Plus, its sleek design adds a modern touch to your laundry room.</span><br></p>','779','778',NULL,300,0,'used','original','+61482072096',0,1,'Sydney, Australia',-33.8688197,151.2092955,0,340,1,1,'2024-06-12 05:52:40','2025-01-30 20:24:13','2024-06-11 01:18:07','2025-01-30 20:24:13'),(75,2,NULL,7,40,NULL,5,9,NULL,NULL,'daewoo microwave 700w','daewoo-microwave-700w','<p>Upgrade your kitchen with the Daewoo 700W microwave, delivering efficient cooking power in a compact design. With its 700 watts of cooking power, this microwave quickly heats up your meals, snacks, and beverages. Its user-friendly interface and intuitive controls make cooking a breeze. Sleek and stylish, it complements any kitchen decor. Don\'t compromise on quality and convenience—experience the reliability of Daewoo today<br></p>','721','722',NULL,500,0,'used','original','+61482072096',0,0,'Rosehill, Australia',-33.8239653,151.0212029,1,184,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:13','2024-06-11 01:24:54','2025-01-30 20:24:13'),(76,2,NULL,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,3,NULL,NULL,'Tuitions and Coaching Classes','tuitions-and-coaching-classes','<li><p><strong>Subject Specialization</strong>: Find specialized tuitions and coaching classes catering to a wide range of subjects, from mathematics and science to languages and humanities.</p></li><li><p><strong>Qualified Instructors</strong>: Connect with experienced and qualified instructors who provide personalized guidance and support to help students excel academically.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible Learning Options</strong>: Discover flexible learning options, including in-person classes, online sessions, and hybrid models, designed to accommodate diverse schedules and learning preferences.</p></li><li><p><strong>Exam Preparation</strong>: Access comprehensive exam preparation courses tailored for standardized tests, competitive exams, and school/college-level assessments to boost confidence and performance.</p></li><li><p><strong>Enhanced Learning Environment</strong>: Immerse yourself in an enriched learning environment that fosters critical thinking, problem-solving skills, and academic excellence, empowering students to reach their full potential.</p></li>','723','724',NULL,200,0,NULL,NULL,'+8801799328264',0,0,'Gazipur, Bangladesh',23.9905079,90.3877184,0,285,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:13','2024-06-11 01:37:14','2025-01-30 20:24:13'),(77,1,NULL,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,14,NULL,NULL,'FluentSpeak - Master Spoken English and IELTS Training','fluentspeak-master-spoken-english-and-ielts-training','FluentSpeak offers comprehensive Spoken English and IELTS training programs designed to equip learners with the language skills and confidence needed to excel in both personal and professional settings. Our expert instructors employ immersive teaching methodologies, interactive sessions, and personalized feedback to enhance speaking, listening, reading, and writing abilities. Whether you\'re aiming for academic success, career advancement, or migration purposes, our tailored curriculum ensures targeted preparation for the IELTS exam, including intensive practice sessions and test-taking strategies. With small class sizes and flexible schedules, FluentSpeak accommodates diverse learning needs and preferences, fostering a supportive and conducive learning environment. Join FluentSpeak today and unlock your potential to communicate fluently, expressively, and effectively in English, opening doors to a world of opportunities.','769','770',NULL,150,0,NULL,NULL,'+8801799328264',0,0,'Dhaka, Bangladesh',23.7777571,90.4057408,1,307,1,1,'2024-06-12 05:34:38','2025-01-30 20:23:10','2024-06-11 01:44:43','2025-01-30 20:23:10'),(78,2,NULL,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,NULL,'Spoken English','spoken-english','<div class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"06b013d8-c099-4b9e-912a-d7736aacb702\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-[3px]\"><div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\"><p>FluentSpeak offers dynamic Spoken English training programs tailored to enhance your communication skills and fluency. Our experienced instructors utilize engaging lessons, interactive exercises, and real-life simulations to build confidence in speaking, listening, and pronunciation. Whether you\'re a beginner looking to start from scratch or an advanced learner aiming for fluency, our curriculum caters to all proficiency levels. With a focus on practical conversation, our classes empower you to navigate everyday situations, professional settings, and social interactions with ease. Join FluentSpeak and embark on a journey to articulate your thoughts, express yourself confidently, and connect with others effectively in English. Unlock the language of opportunity and broaden your horizons with FluentSpeak\'s Spoken English program.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden juice:-ml-3\"><div class=\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\"><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><button class=\"rounded-lg text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary\"><span class=\"flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-md-heavy\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M11 4.90