scovered.','729','730',NULL,100,0,NULL,NULL,'+61482072096',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,167,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:09','2024-06-11 01:53:03','2025-01-30 20:24:09'),(80,2,NULL,5,22,NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,'Discover Kids\' Musical Instruments','discover-kids-musical-instruments','Harmony Haven\" is a whimsical collection of musical instruments tailored for young maestros. From colorful xylophones to playful tambourines, each instrument is crafted to inspire creativity and cultivate a love for music. Designed with safety and durability in mind, our instruments are perfect for little hands to explore rhythm and melody. Spark your child\'s imagination and foster a lifelong passion for music with \"Harmony Haven\" – where every note is a step towards musical mastery.','767','768',NULL,200,0,'new','original','+8801799328264',0,0,'ঢাকা, Bangladesh',23.8040930,90.4152376,1,245,1,1,'2024-06-12 05:20:56','2025-01-30 20:24:09','2024-06-11 02:02:18','2025-01-30 20:24:09'),(81,2,NULL,4,16,NULL,NULL,25,NULL,NULL,'Women\'s jeans pant','women-s-jeans-pant','<p>Indulge in the perfect fit with our range of women\'s jeans pants, available in a variety of sizes to suit every body type. From petite to plus-size, we offer a diverse selection crafted to flatter your curves and enhance your style. Whether you prefer skinny, bootcut, or boyfriend styles, our jeans are designed for comfort and confidence. Explore our collection and find your ideal pair to elevate your everyday look effortlessly.<br></p>','774','773|772|734',NULL,100,1,'new','original','01799328264',0,0,'ঢাকা, Bangladesh',23.8040930,90.4152376,0,244,1,1,'2024-06-12 05:34:38','2025-01-30 20:24:09','2024-06-11 02:11:00','2025-01-30 20:24:09'),(82,2,NULL,4,16,NULL,NULL,15,NULL,NULL,'Women\'s jeans pants winter','women-s-jeans-pants-winter','<p>Indulge in the perfect fit with our range of women\'s jeans pants, available in a variety of sizes to suit every body type. From petite to plus-size, we offer a diverse selection crafted to flatter your curves and enhance your style. Whether you prefer skinny, bootcut, or boyfriend styles, our jeans are designed for comfort and confidence. Explore our collection and find your ideal pair to elevate your everyday look effortlessly.<br></p>','771','772',NULL,120,0,'new','original','+8801799328264',0,0,'Dhaka, Bangladesh',23.8028556,90.3748344,1,324,1,1,'2024-06-12 05:34:38','2025-01-30 20:24:09','2024-06-11 02:12:11','2025-01-30 20:24:09'),(83,2,NULL,2,9,NULL,5,26,NULL,NULL,'LG LED TV 22-Inch','lg-led-tv-22-inch','<p>Experience big entertainment in a compact package with the LG LED TV 22-inch. Perfect for small spaces, dorm rooms, or kitchens, this sleek TV delivers vibrant visuals and crisp sound for an immersive viewing experience. With HD resolution and advanced image enhancement technologies, every scene comes to life with stunning clarity and detail. Equipped with multiple connectivity options, including HDMI and USB ports, you can easily connect your favorite devices for endless entertainment possibilities. Upgrade your viewing experience with the LG LED TV 22-inch – where quality meets convenience<br></p>','740','741|739',NULL,200,0,'used','original','+8801799328264',0,0,'Savar, Bangladesh',23.8499948,90.2636596,1,309,1,1,'2024-06-11 03:12:03','2025-01-30 20:24:09','2024-06-11 02:19:31','2025-01-30 20:24:09'),(84,0,NULL,1,43,NULL,32,4,NULL,NULL,'2021 Volkswagen Polo','2021-volkswagen-polo','<p>Experience the future of driving with the 2024 Volkswagen Polo 1.0. This compact marvel boasts a sleek design and advanced technology, ensuring a smooth and efficient ride. Equipped with a responsive 1.0-liter engine, it delivers impressive fuel efficiency without compromising on performance. Inside, enjoy a comfortable, high-tech interior with cutting-edge infotainment features. The 2024 Polo 1.0 combines style, innovation, and practicality, making it the perfect choice for modern drivers<br></p>','755','753',NULL,15000,1,'used','original','+8801799328264',0,0,'Sydney, Australia',-33.8688197,151.2092955,0,311,1,1,'2024-06-11 05:00:09','2025-01-30 20:26:15','2024-06-11 04:40:19','2025-01-30 20:26:15'),(85,0,NULL,1,43,NULL,12,23,NULL,NULL,'2020 BMW X1 20i sDrive xLine 5dr: Premium SUV with Automatic Excellence','2020-bmw-x1-20i-sdrive-xline-5dr-premium-suv-with-automatic-excellence','<p>The 2020 BMW X1 20i sDrive xLine 5dr Automatic is the epitome of luxury and performance in a compact SUV. This premium vehicle features a robust 2.0-liter petrol engine, delivering smooth and efficient power for all your driving needs. With its sleek xLine trim, the X1 boasts sophisticated styling, including distinctive alloy wheels and elegant design accents. Inside, you\'ll find a spacious and meticulously crafted cabin, equipped with the latest technology and high-quality materials for an unparalleled driving experience. The automatic transmission ensures seamless gear shifts, enhancing both comfort and control. Advanced safety features and driver assistance systems provide peace of mind on every journey. With ample cargo space and versatile seating, the X1 is perfect for both daily commutes and weekend adventures. Experience the blend of dynamic performance and refined luxury with the 2020 BMW X1 20i sDrive xLine. It\'s the ultimate choice for discerning drivers who demand excellence in every aspect of their vehicle<br></p>','758','756',NULL,20000,1,'used','original','+61482072096',0,0,'Sydney, Australia',-33.8688197,151.2092955,0,269,1,1,'2024-06-11 05:00:09','2025-01-30 20:26:15','2024-06-11 04:48:33','2025-01-30 20:26:15'),(86,0,NULL,1,1,1,12,22,NULL,NULL,'2024 BMW S1000R','2024-bmw-s1000r','<p>Experience the thrill of the road with the 2024 BMW S1000R, a high-performance naked bike designed for adrenaline seekers. Powered by a 999cc engine, it delivers exceptional power and agility. Advanced electronics, including dynamic traction control and multiple riding modes, ensure a safe and exhilarating ride. With its aggressive styling and cutting-edge technology, the S1000R stands out in any crowd. Enjoy unmatched performance and precision with the 2024 BMW S1000R – the ultimate streetfighter motorcycle.<br></p>','761','760',NULL,1000,1,'new','original','+61482072096',0,0,'ঢাকা, Bangladesh',23.8040930,90.4152376,0,318,1,1,'2024-06-11 05:00:09','2025-01-30 20:26:15','2024-06-11 04:59:03','2025-01-30 20:26:15'),(87,0,NULL,2,8,NULL,0,16,NULL,NULL,'fsdfsdfsdf','fsdfsdfsdf','<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); font-size: 14px;\">Description&nbsp;</span><span class=\"text-danger\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(minimum 150 characters.)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); font-size: 14px;\">Description&nbsp;</span><span class=\"text-danger\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(minimum 150 characters.)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); font-size: 14px;\">Description&nbsp;</span><span class=\"text-danger\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(minimum 150 characters.)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); font-size: 14px;\">Description&nbsp;</span><span class=\"text-danger\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(minimum 150 characters.)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); font-size: 14px;\">Description&nbsp;</span><span class=\"text-danger\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(minimum 150 characters.)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); font-size: 14px;\">Description&nbsp;</span><span class=\"text-danger\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(minimum 150 characters.)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); font-size: 14px;\">Description&nbsp;</span><span class=\"text-danger\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(minimum 150 characters.)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); font-size: 14px;\">Description&nbsp;</span><span class=\"text-danger\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(minimum 150 characters.)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85); font-size: 14px;\">Description&nbsp;</span><span class=\"text-danger\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">(minimum 150 characters.)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 6