base64,\" data-filename=\"Vector.png\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 16px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Kişisel bilgilerinizi (kimlik, kredi kartı vb.) üçüncü şahıslarla paylaşmayın.</span></span></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: rgb(15, 23, 42); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"Vector.png\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Satıcı veya alıcıyı araştırmadan işlem yapmayın, dolandırıcılığa karşı dikkatli olun.</span></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: rgb(15, 23, 42); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"Vector.png\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">Şüpheli ilan veya kullanıcıları textileforum.net yetkililerine bildirin.</span></li></ol></span></li></ol><div class=\"safety-list safety1\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: rgb(15, 23, 42); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 247, 237); line-height: 1.5;\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\"></div>','2024-04-23 01:53:04','2026-06-07 03:23:51'),(232,'user_identity_verification_subject','User Verification Request','2024-04-28 01:22:31','2024-04-28 01:22:31'),(233,'admin_user_identity_verification_message','<p>Hello @name,</p></p>You have a new request for user verification. Email: @email</p>','2024-04-28 01:22:31','2024-04-28 01:22:31'),(234,'membership_image_show_hide','on','2024-04-29 23:50:27','2024-04-29 23:52:00'),(235,'blog_comment_load_more_title','Load More','2024-05-07 00:51:16','2024-05-29 07:05:31'),(236,'listing_filter_page_url','ilanlar','2024-0